        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_a28153a36f1b432cbcd2efd5693b8e8f",
      "statement": "The Deploy workflow's changes job diffs frontend/ and backend/ between github.event.before and github.sha, but a workflow_dispatch run has no usable base ref (empty, all-zero or unknown SHA), so it sets both outputs true and a manual run always deploys both projects.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://.github/workflows/deploy.yml#L23-L53",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9a648b22630b4a5c1f286910a69e707915a5c3ec6364689cc77ab918c1748796:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_9c5adafb44824f6b9f257f6d2474f247",
      "statement": "The frontend and backend jobs each depend only on the changes job, so they run in parallel with no ordering between them; each runs `vercel deploy --prod --yes` for its project (sangam, sangam-backend) in the production environment, with Vercel building remotely (no --prebuilt) from the repo root and the project's Root Directory setting selecting the subdirectory.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://.github/workflows/deploy.yml#L55-L86",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b6d1fe342a35a3680bbf40f325856e3973bacd16de428a09f97a69f5b0c013d7:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_39f737a637b2483c9081a6119b28032e",
      "statement": "Only VERCEL_TOKEN is a secret; VERCEL_ORG_ID is a hard-coded team identifier in the workflow env, jobs name projects with --project, and the workflow has contents: read permission only.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://.github/workflows/deploy.yml#L8-L21",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:23073937cd1cb1748045df02c4562ce304dc485c7ed54a6027b017e2cbc22142:"
